  <body dur="01:25.270">
    <div begin="00:02.000" end="01:25.270">
      <p begin="00:02.000" end="00:04.640" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:02.000" end="00:02.220">Как</span> <span begin="00:02.370" end="00:02.870">пре</span><span begin="00:02.870" end="00:02.970">ж</span><span begin="00:02.970" end="00:03.320">де</span> <span begin="00:03.320" end="00:03.450">сей</span><span begin="00:03.550" end="00:04.400">ча</span><span begin="00:04.400" end="00:04.640">с</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今仍如往昔</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">如今仍如往昔</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Now as before</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">今も かつてと同じように</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">예전처럼 지금도</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Comme autrefois à présent</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Como antes ahora</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wie einst so auch jetzt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Como antes agora</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kak prezhde seychas</span></p>
      <p begin="00:06.780" end="00:09.320" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:06.780" end="00:07.180">Зем</span><span begin="00:07.180" end="00:07.670">ля</span> <span begin="00:07.670" end="00:07.810">вз</span><span begin="00:07.810" end="00:07.990">ды</span><span begin="00:07.990" end="00:08.280">хает</span> <span begin="00:08.390" end="00:09.070">не</span><span begin="00:09.070" end="00:09.190">ж</span><span begin="00:09.190" end="00:09.320">но</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">大地轻柔地叹息</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">大地輕柔地嘆息</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The earth sighs softly</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">大地は静かに息をつく</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">대지는 부드럽게 숨을 내쉬고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La terre soupire doucement</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La tierra suspira suavemente</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die Erde seufzt sanft</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A terra suspira suavemente</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Zemlya vzdykhayet nezhno</span></p>
      <p begin="00:10.780" end="00:17.790" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:10.780" end="00:11.770">Лу</span><span begin="00:11.970" end="00:12.740">чи</span> <span begin="00:13.580" end="00:14.410">е</span><span begin="00:14.410" end="00:15.000">ё</span> <span begin="00:15.550" end="00:16.530">на</span><span begin="00:16.530" end="00:16.730">с</span> <span begin="00:16.730" end="00:17.560">грею</span><span begin="00:17.750" end="00:17.790">т</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">她的光芒温暖着我们</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">她的光芒溫暖著我們</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Her rays keep us warm</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">その光が私たちを暖める</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그 빛줄기는 우리를 따스하게 감싸</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ses rayons nous réchauffent</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sus rayos nos dan calor</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ihre Strahlen wärmen uns</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Seus raios nos aquecem</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Luchi yeyo nas greyut</span></p>
      <p begin="00:18.360" end="00:25.050" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:18.360" end="00:18.760">Мы</span> <span begin="00:18.760" end="00:19.090">и</span><span begin="00:19.200" end="00:19.890">дём</span> <span begin="00:20.410" end="00:21.350">на</span> <span begin="00:21.350" end="00:21.560">з</span><span begin="00:21.560" end="00:22.460">ов</span> <span begin="00:23.240" end="00:24.000">е</span><span begin="00:24.000" end="00:25.050">ё</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们循着她的召唤前行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我們循著她的召喚前行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">We march at her call</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">私たちはその呼び声へと歩んでゆく</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리는 그 부름을 따라 나아가</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Nous marchons à son appel</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Caminamos siguiendo su llamada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wir folgen ihrem Ruf</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Seguimos ao chamado dela</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">My idyom na zov yeyo</span></p>
      <p begin="00:26.410" end="00:30.460" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:26.410" end="00:26.590">От</span><span begin="00:26.820" end="00:27.450">вет</span> <span begin="00:28.790" end="00:29.000">гром</span><span begin="00:29.000" end="00:29.120">че</span> <span begin="00:29.210" end="00:29.720">го</span><span begin="00:29.720" end="00:29.830">ло</span><span begin="00:29.940" end="00:30.460">сов</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">回应盖过了所有声音</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">回應蓋過了所有聲音</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The answer rings louder than voices</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">答えはあらゆる声より高く響く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">대답은 목소리보다 더 크게 울리고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La réponse résonne plus fort que les voix</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La respuesta resuena más fuerte que las voces</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die Antwort ist lauter als Stimmen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A resposta é mais alta que as vozes</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Otvet gromche golosov</span></p>
      <p begin="00:31.960" end="00:37.090" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:31.960" end="00:32.180">Со</span><span begin="00:32.410" end="00:33.020">мне</span><span begin="00:33.020" end="00:33.260">ний</span> <span begin="00:33.260" end="00:33.850">не</span><span begin="00:33.850" end="00:33.900">т</span> <span begin="00:34.290" end="00:34.400">в</span> <span begin="00:34.400" end="00:34.520">том,</span> <span begin="00:34.520" end="00:34.780">что</span> <span begin="00:34.780" end="00:35.620">и</span><span begin="00:35.620" end="00:35.900">с</span><span begin="00:36.000" end="00:36.190">ти</span><span begin="00:36.190" end="00:36.320">на</span> <span begin="00:36.410" end="00:36.840">е</span><span begin="00:37.010" end="00:37.090">сть</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们从未怀疑 真理确然存在</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我們從未懷疑 真理確然存在</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">There is no doubt that truth exists</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">真実があることに もう疑いはない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">진실이 존재한다는 데에는 의심이 없어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Nul doute que la vérité existe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No hay duda de que la verdad existe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Kein Zweifel daran dass es Wahrheit gibt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não há dúvida de que a verdade existe</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Somneniy net v tom, shto istina yest'</span></p>
      <p begin="00:37.600" end="00:47.550" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:37.600" end="00:37.820">И</span> <span begin="00:37.950" end="00:38.580">е</span><span begin="00:38.580" end="00:38.820">с</span><span begin="00:38.820" end="00:39.470">ли</span> <span begin="00:39.610" end="00:40.570">бы</span> <span begin="00:41.590" end="00:41.770">толь</span><span begin="00:41.770" end="00:41.880">ко</span> <span begin="00:41.880" end="00:42.020">з</span><span begin="00:42.020" end="00:42.810">на</span><span begin="00:42.810" end="00:43.570">ли мы</span> <span begin="00:44.590" end="00:44.690">в</span><span begin="00:44.690" end="00:44.800">с</span><span begin="00:44.800" end="00:45.040">ё</span> <span begin="00:45.040" end="00:45.210">с</span><span begin="00:45.210" end="00:45.710">на</span><span begin="00:45.970" end="00:46.530">ча</span><span begin="00:47.160" end="00:47.550">ла</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">倘若从一开始 我们便知晓这一切</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">倘若從一開始 我們便知曉這一切</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">And if only we had known everything from the start</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">もし初めからすべてを知っていたなら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">처음부터 모든 것을 알 수만 있었다면</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et si seulement nous avions tout su dès le début</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y si tan solo lo hubiéramos sabido todo desde el principio</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und hätten wir doch nur von Anfang an alles gewusst</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E se ao menos soubéssemos tudo desde o começo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">I yesli by tol'ko znali my vsyo snachala</span></p>
      <p begin="00:47.620" end="00:53.560" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:47.620" end="00:48.280">Иным</span> <span begin="00:48.820" end="00:49.000">бы</span> <span begin="00:49.000" end="00:49.220">с</span><span begin="00:49.220" end="00:49.740">та</span><span begin="00:49.740" end="00:49.960">ло</span> <span begin="00:50.800" end="00:51.240">на</span><span begin="00:51.240" end="00:51.530">ше</span> <span begin="00:52.400" end="00:52.680">бу</span><span begin="00:52.680" end="00:52.780">ду</span><span begin="00:52.870" end="00:53.080">ще</span><span begin="00:53.080" end="00:53.560">е</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的未来 或许便会截然不同</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我們的未來 或許便會截然不同</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Our future would have been different</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">私たちの未来は違うものになっていただろう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리의 미래는 달라졌을 텐데</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Notre avenir aurait été tout autre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Nuestro futuro habría sido distinto</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Unsere Zukunft wäre eine andere geworden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Diferente teria sido o nosso futuro</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Inym by stalo nashe budushcheye</span></p>
      <p begin="00:58.360" end="01:01.180" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:58.360" end="00:58.570">Ка</span><span begin="00:58.570" end="00:58.610">к</span> <span begin="00:58.780" end="00:59.490">пре</span><span begin="00:59.490" end="00:59.590">ж</span><span begin="00:59.590" end="00:59.770">де</span> <span begin="00:59.770" end="00:59.880">сей</span><span begin="00:59.990" end="01:00.940">ча</span><span begin="01:00.940" end="01:01.180">с</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今仍如往昔</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">如今仍如往昔</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Now as before</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">今も かつてと同じように</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">예전처럼 지금도</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Comme autrefois à présent</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Como antes ahora</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wie einst so auch jetzt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Como antes agora</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kak prezhde seychas</span></p>
      <p begin="01:04.760" end="01:10.570" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="01:04.760" end="01:05.160">Зем</span><span begin="01:05.160" end="01:05.220">л</span><span begin="01:05.220" end="01:05.850">я</span> <span begin="01:05.850" end="01:05.980">в</span><span begin="01:05.980" end="01:06.240">ды</span><span begin="01:06.390" end="01:07.600">ха</span><span begin="01:08.010" end="01:08.310">ет</span> <span begin="01:08.310" end="01:08.380">в</span><span begin="01:08.380" end="01:08.490">з</span><span begin="01:08.490" end="01:09.640">ры</span><span begin="01:09.990" end="01:10.570">вы</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">大地吸入了爆炸的轰鸣</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">大地吸入了爆炸的轟鳴</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The earth breathes in explosions</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">大地は爆炎を吸い込んでいる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">대지는 폭발을 들이마시고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La terre respire les explosions</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La tierra respira las explosiones</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die Erde atmet Explosionen ein</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A terra respira as explosões</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Zemlya vdykhayet vzryvy</span></p>
      <p begin="01:11.120" end="01:13.570" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="01:11.120" end="01:11.220">С</span><span begin="01:11.220" end="01:11.370">ерд</span><span begin="01:11.570" end="01:12.170">ца</span> <span begin="01:12.170" end="01:12.280">на</span><span begin="01:12.380" end="01:12.570">ши</span> <span begin="01:12.570" end="01:12.770">го</span><span begin="01:12.770" end="01:13.390">ря</span><span begin="01:13.530" end="01:13.570">т</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的心正在燃烧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我們的心正在燃燒</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Our hearts are burning</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">私たちの心は燃えている</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리의 심장은 불타올라</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Nos cœurs brûlent</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Nuestros corazones arden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Unsere Herzen stehen in Flammen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Nossos corações ardem</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Serdtsa nashi goryat</span></p>
      <p begin="01:14.360" end="01:20.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="01:14.360" end="01:14.680">Зов</span> <span begin="01:14.800" end="01:15.200">би</span><span begin="01:15.300" end="01:15.340">т</span><span begin="01:15.340" end="01:15.560">вы</span> <span begin="01:15.560" end="01:15.760">раз</span><span begin="01:15.760" end="01:15.880">жи</span><span begin="01:16.000" end="01:16.790">га</span><span begin="01:16.790" end="01:17.130">е</span><span begin="01:17.130" end="01:17.200">т</span> <span begin="01:17.940" end="01:18.460">кровь</span> <span begin="01:18.460" end="01:18.570">в</span> <span begin="01:18.570" end="01:18.760">на</span><span begin="01:18.760" end="01:18.900">ших</span> <span begin="01:19.010" end="01:19.180">те</span><span begin="01:19.180" end="01:20.000">лах</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">战斗的召唤 令热血在我们体内燃烧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">戰鬥的召喚 令熱血在我們體內燃燒</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The call of battle sets the blood in our bodies ablaze</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">戦いの呼び声が この身を巡る血を燃え上がらせる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">전투의 부름이 우리 몸속 피를 끓어오르게 해</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">L’appel du combat embrase le sang dans nos corps</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La llamada de la batalla enciende la sangre en nuestros cuerpos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Der Ruf der Schlacht lässt das Blut in unseren Körpern entflammen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O chamado da batalha incendeia o sangue em nossos corpos</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Zov bitvy razzhigayet krov' v nashikh telakh</span></p>
      <p begin="01:20.800" end="01:21.970" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="01:20.800" end="01:21.230">По</span><span begin="01:21.230" end="01:21.970">ра</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">时机已到</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">時機已到</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">It is time</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">時は来た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">때가 왔어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">L’heure est venue</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Es la hora</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Es ist Zeit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">É hora</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Pora</span></p>
